{title: So Easy (To Fall In Love)}
{artist: Olivia Dean}
{key: Eb}

{start_of_verse: Intro}
[Fm7] [Gm7]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Ab/Bb]I could be the twist, the one to make you stop
[Ebmaj7]The icing on your cake, the cherry on the [Edim7]top
[Ab/Bb]There's Heaven in my heart, and we could find you some [Ebmaj7]space
[Edim7]Mm-mm
[Ab/Bb]I could be the world to you, the missing piece
[Ebmaj7]The extra sentimental kind of [Edim7]chemistry
[Ab/Bb]Some people make it hard, with me, that isn't the [Ebmaj7]case
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
'Cause [Edim7]I make it so [Fm7]easy to [Bb7]fall in [Cm7]love
So, [C7]come give me a [Fm7]call, and we'll [Bb7]fall into [Cm7]us
I'm the [C7]perfect mix of [Fm7]Saturday night and the [Bb7]rest of your life
[Cm7]Anyone with a heart would [Adim7]agree
[Fm7]It's so easy
To [Gm7]fall in love with [Bb7]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Ab/Bb]The way I do my hair, the way I make you laugh
[Ebmaj7]The way we like to share a walk in [Edim7]Central Park
[Ab/Bb]I could be fresh air, might be the girl of your [Ebmaj7]dreams
Mm
There's no [Ab/Bb]need to hide if you're into me
'Cause [Ebmaj7]I'm into you quite [Edim7]intimately
And [Ab/Bb]maybe one night could turn into three
Well, [Ebmaj7]I'm down to see
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
'Cause [Edim7]I make it so [Fm7]easy to [Bb7]fall in [Cm7]love
So, [C7]come give me a [Fm7]call, and we'll [Bb7]fall into [Cm7]us
I'm the [C7]perfect mix of [Fm7]Saturday night and the [Bb7]rest of your life
[Cm7]Anyone with a heart would [Adim7]agree
[Fm7]It's so easy
To [Gm7]fall in love with
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Ab/Bb]Me
[Ebmaj7]Me [Edim7]
[Ab/Bb]Me [Ebmaj7] [Edim7]
[Ab/Bb]It's so easy
[Ebmaj7]It's so [Edim7]easy
[Ab/Bb]It's so easy
